cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this tool, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "municipal-cyber-policy-analytics: Automated NIST CSF 2.0 Benchmarking for Municipal Cybersecurity Policy"
abstract: >
  A reproducible Python pipeline that benchmarks municipal cybersecurity readiness
  by classifying government policy documents against the six NIST Cybersecurity
  Framework 2.0 functions (Govern, Identify, Protect, Detect, Respond, Recover)
  using both keyword-based and AI-assisted classification methods.
